  reportName: "Report 01 \u2014 Population Status"
  reportDescription: "On board the intergalactic station \u201CAthea\u201D there
    are:\r\nColonists: 20,000 individuals in stasis.\r\nCrew: 457 specialists, including
    officers, engineers, and medics \u2014 also in cryosleep.\r\n The official mission
    goal is the transportation of colonists to the planet Eden-7, located 27 light
    years from Earth.\r\n All cryo-chambers are functioning in stable condition.
    No active system administrators are present."
